---

const routes = [
  {
    prompt: 'Necesito lanzar algo nuevo',
    title: 'Producto y software',
    description: 'De una idea o proceso particular a un SaaS, portal, backoffice o plataforma lista para operar.',
    capabilities: ['Estrategia de producto', 'UX/UI', 'Frontend y backend', 'APIs', 'Infraestructura'],
    href: '/servicios/desarrollo-software-a-medida/',
  },
  {
    prompt: 'Necesito operar con menos fricción',
    title: 'Automatización e IA',
    description: 'Conectamos herramientas, conocimiento y decisiones para eliminar trabajo manual y coordinar acciones confiables.',
    capabilities: ['n8n', 'Agentes y copilotos', 'WhatsApp', 'CRM y ERP', 'Guardrails'],
    href: '/servicios/automatizacion-procesos/',
  },
  {
    prompt: 'Necesito vender y posicionarme mejor',
    title: 'Web y búsqueda con IA',
    description: 'Construimos el canal digital para que tu oferta se encuentre, se entienda y se elija en buscadores, respuestas de IA y recorridos agénticos.',
    capabilities: ['Sitios y e-commerce', 'SEO técnico', 'GEO / AEO', 'Datos estructurados', 'Conversión'],
    href: '/servicios/landing-pages-seo/',
  },
];
---

<section id="servicios" class="section-pad services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="services-head" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Empieza por lo que quieres cambiar</p>
        <h2 id="services-title" class="section-title">No necesitas saber cómo se llama la solución.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Trae el problema, la oportunidad o el resultado que buscas. Nosotros conectamos estrategia, diseño e ingeniería para encontrar la forma correcta de resolverlo.</p>
    </header>

    <nav class="service-routes" aria-label="Rutas para encontrar un servicio">
      {routes.map((route) => (
        <a class="service-route" href={route.href} data-reveal>
          <p class="route-prompt">{route.prompt}</p>
          <div class="route-name"><h3>{route.title}</h3></div>
          <p class="route-description">{route.description}</p>
          <ul>{route.capabilities.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
        </a>
      ))}
    </nav>

    <aside class="consulting-callout" data-reveal>
      <p><span>¿Todavía no sabes qué conviene construir?</span> Podemos comenzar con diagnóstico y arquitectura para revisar procesos, sistemas, riesgos y alternativas antes de invertir.</p>
      <a href="/servicios/consultoria-arquitectura-tecnologica/">Revisar consultoría estratégica</a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services { position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: radial-gradient(circle at 8% 15%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 9%, transparent), transparent 24%), var(--white); }
  .services-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .52fr; align-items: end; gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem); margin-bottom: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 6rem); }
  .services-head > p { margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .94rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .service-routes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  .service-route { position: relative; display: grid; min-width: 0; min-height: 25rem; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-areas: "prompt" "name" "description" "capabilities"; align-content: start; gap: 1.2rem; padding: clamp(2.25rem, 3.5vw, 3.75rem); overflow: hidden; border-radius: 3rem 3rem 6rem 3rem; background: var(--paper-deep); color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; transition: transform 320ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), box-shadow 320ms ease; }
  .service-route:nth-child(1) { grid-column: 1 / span 6; }
  .service-route:nth-child(2) { grid-column: 7 / -1; border-radius: 3rem 6rem 3rem 3rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue-soft) 72%, var(--white)); }
  .service-route:nth-child(3) { grid-column: 4 / -1; min-height: 23rem; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .88fr) minmax(18rem, 1.12fr); grid-template-areas: "prompt prompt" "name description" "name capabilities"; column-gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem); margin-top: .25rem; border-radius: 6rem 3rem 3rem 3rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper-deep) 78%, var(--blue-soft)); color: var(--ink); }
  .service-route::before { position: absolute; right: -5rem; bottom: -6rem; width: 15rem; height: 13rem; border-radius: 45% 55% 64% 36% / 59% 38% 62% 41%; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 12%, transparent); content: ''; transition: transform 500ms ease; }
  .service-route:hover { transform: translateY(-.35rem); box-shadow: 0 24px 65px rgb(22 33 49 / .12); }
  .service-route:hover::before { transform: translate(-1rem, -1rem) scale(1.12); }
  .route-prompt { grid-area: prompt; margin: 0 0 .75rem; color: var(--blue); font-size: .61rem; font-weight: 740; letter-spacing: .045em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .route-name { display: block; min-width: 0; grid-area: name; }
  .route-name h3 { max-width: 10ch; margin: 0; overflow-wrap: normal; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 4.2vw, 4.6rem); font-weight: 680; letter-spacing: -.075em; line-height: .9; }
  .service-route:nth-child(2) .route-name h3 { max-width: 11ch; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 4vw, 4.4rem); }
  .route-description { max-width: 32rem; grid-area: description; margin: .2rem 0 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .87rem; line-height: 1.72; }
  .service-route ul { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; grid-area: capabilities; gap: .55rem 1.15rem; margin: 1rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .service-route li { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: .58rem; font-weight: 650; }
  .service-route li:not(:last-child)::after { display: none; }
  .service-route:nth-child(3) .route-description { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .service-route:nth-child(3) li { color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .service-route:nth-child(3) .route-prompt { color: var(--blue); }
  .consulting-callout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 2rem; margin: 3rem 0 0 auto; padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem; width: min(100%, 58rem); border: 0; border-radius: 2rem; background: var(--glass); box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(145%); backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(145%); }
  .consulting-callout p { max-width: 48rem; margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .74rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .consulting-callout p span { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 740; }
  .consulting-callout a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; color: var(--blue-dark); font-size: .65rem; font-weight: 720; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .services-head, .service-route { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .service-route:nth-child(n) { grid-column: 1 / -1; min-height: 0; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-areas: "prompt" "name" "description" "capabilities"; margin-top: 0; }
    .service-route > * { min-width: 0; }
    .service-route ul { grid-column: 1; }
    .route-name { max-width: 44rem; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .service-route { gap: 1.2rem; padding: 2rem 1.5rem 2.5rem; border-radius: 2rem 2rem 4rem 2rem; }
    .route-name { position: relative; display: block; }
    .route-name h3, .service-route:nth-child(2) .route-name h3 { max-width: 9.5ch; font-size: clamp(2.55rem, 12.5vw, 3.65rem); overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; }
    .route-description { max-width: 29rem; font-size: .9rem; overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; }
    .service-route ul { margin-top: .35rem; }
    .consulting-callout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .consulting-callout a { white-space: normal; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .service-route:hover { transform: none; } }
</style>
